\code{pushes} triple and a \code{type} block (id, name, description). This wrapper
returns one row per split. The ATS records are populated only for
completed games, so an in-progress or future season may return an empty
frame.

When \code{team_detail = TRUE} (the default) the ESPN team catalog
(\code{\link[=espn_cfb_teams]{espn_cfb_teams()}}) is fetched once and friendly team fields are joined
